    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully choose when to swap and where to position the champions you've swapped out because the other two champion will be in idle position</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No toxic teammates\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blame only yourself</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't wait for opportunities\u2014create your own.\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/0ec305eed763c61cf80b7cd7e55b8831.avif?t=1755546940\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/aadcf612ecff8e172198278228bdec3b.poster.avif?t=1755546940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/aadcf612ecff8e172198278228bdec3b.webm?t=1755546940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/aadcf612ecff8e172198278228bdec3b.mp4?t=1755546940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High level gameplay\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Perform combos with your champions by swiftly swapping between the</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/8d7e6ec7071418860783c00a78502e36.avif?t=1755546940\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/4ecce21850a15032de966e9949bf1333.poster.avif?t=1755546940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/4ecce21850a15032de966e9949bf1333.webm?t=1755546940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/4ecce21850a15032de966e9949bf1333.mp4?t=1755546940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short intense battle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOBA fighting game\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No farming minions\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No waiting for action\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 minute round (game have 2 rounds one you play as attacker one as defender)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump straight into the action\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attackers\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attackers can't target the objective until they destroy at least one tower</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy towers to spawn minions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attackers win If the objective is destroyed before the time runs out,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/ac14afc6d10390cdae9e288dd6597bc9.avif?t=1755546940\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/ce7e09972b2e51a24b9d4112f35059c4.poster.avif?t=1755546940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/ce7e09972b2e51a24b9d4112f35059c4.webm?t=1755546940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/ce7e09972b2e51a24b9d4112f35059c4.mp4?t=1755546940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defenders\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your towers by Linking your champions to them to absorb the damage dealt to them, but be careful as your champions will take more damage when the tower is hit.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defenders win when the time runs out and your objective is still standing\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/5670e34c46af39945d27030d1cebe089.avif?t=1755546940\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/eab1efcc89afc69a3b3797b2449f75d6.poster.avif?t=1755546940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/eab1efcc89afc69a3b3797b2449f75d6.webm?t=1755546940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233940/extras/eab1efcc89afc69a3b3797b2449f75d6.mp4?t=1755546940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p>",
